OL,3,GNEWSAFire call outs double year-on-year
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe number of fires in York and North
OL,6,FYorkshire in the last two months has
OL,7,Fmore than doubled year-on-year.
OL,9,FNorth Yorkshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,10,Fsaid it had responded to 567 fires
OL,11,Fbetween the start of July and 17 August
OL,12,Fcompared to 256 during the same period
OL,13,Flast year.
OL,15,FWildfires alone accounted for 32 fires
OL,16,Ffrom the beginning of July, with the
OL,17,Fhighest number of call outs in Acomb,
OL,18,FMalton and Scarborough.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
