OL,3,GNEWSAFire call outs double year-on-year
OL,4,
OL,5,FA service spokesperson said more call
OL,6,Fouts had placed additional demand on
OL,7,Fthem, affecting firefighters and other
OL,8,Fareas of work including road risk,
OL,9,Fcommunity safety and training.
